    {
      "name": "Breath Weapon",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "fire"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The Xotanispawn sprays a 60 foot cone of magma that deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">10d10</span> fire damage and <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> persistent fire damage to all creatures in the area (DC 39 basic Reflex save).</p>\n<p>The Xotanispawn can't use its Breath Weapon again for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Heat Surge",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>When the Xotanispawn critically hits, its body surges with heat, increasing the damage of its Internal Furnace to <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">10d8</span> persistent plus fire damage until the start of its next turn.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
